    {
      "rank": 10,
      "row_id": 199019,
      "chunk_id": "046ec11bde6b_4",
      "doc_id": "046ec11bde6b",
      "text": "Processor Speed- Calling this phone fast is an understatement, I've tried my best at times to get this phone to slow down and just can't do it. Everything is snappy and instantaneous whether you're opening an app or loading a web page. This phone doesn't break a sweat! Camera quality - The camera on this phone is fantastic, the photos are amazing, with one downside low light photos fo have more noise than I'd like in them. I'll attach some example's to this review so you can see for yourself. This phone won't replace a high end dedicated camera, but you could do a lot worse. Battery Life - I have to give credit to both Samsung and android for this one. The battery life on this phone is outstanding, i can get two and a half days out of this phone easy.",
      "score": 0.03375971583369087,
