      "row_id": 245004,
      "chunk_id": "5ee531a161fb_0",
      "doc_id": "5ee531a161fb",
      "text": "Upgrade from J7. Good phone. I had a J7 before so the speed and storage speed has drastically increased. I also really like the split screen function. The battery life leaves much to be desired. A fully charged battery usually lasts me from 5:00 p.m. to 11:00 a.m. the next day. Someone can let me know if this is the norm. Meh it's speedy and cute.",
