    {
      "rank": 13,
      "row_id": 179003,
      "chunk_id": "135431159ec8_1",
      "doc_id": "135431159ec8",
      "text": "The S8 is a true black, and it looks much better than the old option. Samsung has brought back expandable storage, which is one of my favorite features. The phone comes with 64 GB of storage, but the option to add an SD card is important for many users who have a lot of photos and media. The battery life on this phone is great so far. Granted, I have only had the phone a month. One key to making the battery last a long time is adjusting the display settings. When the screen is set to one of the lower resolutions, it still looks crisp, and battery life is extended. The last (and most important) criterion sounds general, but I have yet to be disappointed in how this phone functions. The sound quality for phone calls is much higher quality than on any other phone I have used.",
      "score": 0.03338525826471825,
      "brand": "Samsung",
      "model": "Galaxy S8",
